window.products.push({"id":86087,"name":"Upgraded W10780048 Washing Machine Suspension Rod Kit with W10400895 Suspension Springs by Techecook - Compatible for Whirlpool Kenmore Washer Suspens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iTOZ4kSdL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【WIDE COMPATIBLE】W10780048 washer suspension rods kit compatible with whirlpool kenmore maytag amana admiral crosley roper washing machine. Replaces: w10257087, w10257088, w10349191, w10349193, w10748952, w10821948, 4185114, ap5971398, eap11703290, ps11703290, wtw4800xq2, wtw4800xq4, ntw4600yq1, rtw4640yq1, wtw4800xq1, atw4675yq1, 7mwtw1709dm1, 11020022013, 7mwtw1501aw0, 7mwtw1501aw1, 7mwtw1501aw2, etc. W10400895 washer suspension spring replaces: 1938554 w10348658 w10400895vp ap5263280 ps3497596 eap3497596, etc. If you can't confirm whether the model is suitable, please let us confirm it for you ✅【W10780048 WASHER SUSPENSION RODS】►W10780048 whirlpool washer suspension rods support the wash tub and keeps it stable during unbalanced loads, acts as a shock absorber that allows the washer tub to move while helping minimize vibration in the spin mode. If the washer loses balance or code error, use the damper to keep balance back to normal use. The unbalanced load error \"uL\" in cabrio style machines is often caused by faulty suspension ✅【W10400895 WASHER SUSPENSION SPRING】W10400895 washing machine suspension spring is located between the washer drum and the suspension bar, one at each of the four corners of the washer to make the washer more stable during rotation. The upgraded material of the w10400895 washer tub centering spring is not easily deformed and can be extended to its original shape, showing the unique expansion and contraction characteristics of the spring ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】Including 4 x W10780048 washer suspension rod kit, 4 x W10400895 washer suspension spring. Length 23.6in/60cm. The W10780048 washing machine suspension rod kit is made of stainless steel, ABS plastic material, silicone structure, hook design, strong and durable. W10780048 suspension rod has black coating on the surface to avoid the problem of rusting of the suspension bar. W10780048 kenmore washer suspension rod kit helps dampen the movement of the washer tub. If one or more suspension rods break, the washer will vibrate or shake ✅【REPAIR OF SYMPTOMS】If your washer has any of the following problems: ❶Noisy ❷Code error ❸Washer was out of balance ❹Washing machine shakes badly ❺Suspension rod is broken, you may need a new w10780048 suspension rod kit to get your washer back in working order ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】During the 365 days warranty period, if w10780048 & w10400895 whirlpool suspension kit has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customers' satisfaction are our unremitting pursuit. If you have any questions about our products or services, please feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iTOZ4kSdL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08TM9Q7XC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-86087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TM9Q7XC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TM9Q7XC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
