window.products.push({"id":86133,"name":"Fill N Save Elite Series Stainless Steel Reusable K Cup for Keurig 2.0 and Backward Compatible With Original Keurig 1.0 Models. Works with Keurig Mach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hz6q-bnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAQ Keurig 2.0 If you have a Keurig 2.0 Machine you must place the Orange Freedom Stickers that come free of charge with your ELITE SERIES K cups for it to work in Keurig 2.0 Machines. . How much coffee should I fill the Fill N Save Elite Series? The ELITE SERIES K Cups are specially designed to brew coffee slowly therefore giving you a powerful and more flavorful cup of coffee. Average brew time is about 1 minute. We recommend filling approximately 75-85% What type of coffee Grind is best ? We recommend Medium Grind Coffee , Fine ground coffee ( Like espresso for example) tends to retain a lot of water and you will not get a full cup of coffee Too Coarse ground coffee (that is to say not ground enough and have bigger chunks) the water will pass right through and not fully absorb the the coffee resulting in a weak water down coffee Special Features The container is completely steel including the hinge. It has a rubber O-ring to seal the top Most K-Cups are the same size and work in every machine. This device is the same size as K-cups, takes your own brand of ground coffee, and works in the 250 series machines, which are engineered to recognize Keurig brand K-cups. No paper filter is required. All you have to do is fill it with your favorite ground coffee and place in the Keurig as you would a normal pod for brewing.It is lead free. There are no welds, it is a stamped stainless steelYou do NOT have to use paper filters. ADD this ELITE SERIES Fill N Save Reusable K Cup TO YOUR CART today to start saving money and enjoying great tasting coffee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hz6q-bnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fill N Save","source_asin":"B017UV2FMC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-86133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017UV2FMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B017UV2FMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
