window.products.push({"id":86340,"name":"Siwdoy 3387134 3977767 Dryer Thermostat and 3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse Compatible with Whirlpool Dryer Replaces 3399693 WP3977767VP PS345113 AP6008325","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J+MtG-2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 3387134 Dryer Thermostat made to fit a variety of Whirlpool clothes dryers. May also fit other makes and models of clothes dryers. Dryer cycling thermostat with internal bias heater. Opens at 155F, closes at 130F. 3387134 thermostat Replaces part numbers AP3131939, PS344510, ET187, 3387139, 3387135 The 3977767 Dryer Thermostat Replacement isa hi-limit thermostat with Terminal Extension Arm. It acts as as safety mechanism that keeps the dryer from overheating. Once the dryer temperature reaches 221 degrees Farenheit, this piece will shut down power to the heating element until it drops by 80 degrees Farenheit The 3392519 dryer thermal fuse is used indryers as a safety mechanism that stops the flow of electricity to the motor circuit when a dryer overheats. This replacement part features two 3/16 inch terminals, and is sold individually. When this fuse is faulty, your dryer will not start or it will not heat properly. This is a one-time fuse, meaning it cannot be re-set. It must be replaced when there is no longer continuity between the terminals. It attaches to the blower wheel housing. Blown fuses can be caused by clogged dryer vents. We recommend checking to make sure all of the vents are clear when you perform this repair. Works with most top name brands: Whirlpool, Roper, Estate, Inglis, KitchenAid, Crosley, Amana, Admiral, Magic Chef. Package list: 1PC 3977767 Dryer Thermostat 1PC 3387134 Dryer Thermostat 1PC 3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse Siwdoy Customer Service Siwdoy is committed to providing each customer best customer service. if any question ,Please don't hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J+MtG-2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siwdoy","source_asin":"B07BNBYKLP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-86340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BNBYKLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BNBYKLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
