window.products.push({"id":86733,"name":"TourKing Stove Cover,Stove Top Protectors for Gas Range Stove,0.4 mm Thick Reusable Gas Stove Burner Covers,Washable Stove Protector,Non-Stick Stove L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U-Muxg1QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【High quality material】The gas cooker cover is made of high quality teflon material, non-stick, strong and reusable. The thickness of our furnace top cover is 0.4mm, which is more durable than the 0.2mm thickness common in the market.This stove liner is a perfect backup for your daily cooking. 【Withstand Temperature】Gas stove burner covers for Samsung has a high-quality high temperature resistance up to 570°C/1050℉, the silicone electric stove gap covers has a heat resistance up to 230°C/446℉, it will not melt, deform, or produce any peculiar smell during frequent cooking.Reminder: Please avoid direct contact with the fire source! 【Easy to Clean and Use】 - Gas range cover top for Samsung has non-stick coating keeps gas plates clean, if the stove guard accidentally get dirty during daily use, you just need to wipe it with a towel. When it gets too dirty, you can wash it with soap in the sink or put it in the dishwashe. 【Save time cleaning the cooker】The stove covers are specially designed for Samsung gas ranges and fit the range well.The surface of stove protector mat has non-stick treatment, which can effectively prevent oil and stains. Put reusable stove top cover on your stovetop to help you to cook food while keeping the stove tidy. 【Widely used】Dimensions 16.3 x 24.4 inches,0.4mm, it works perfectly with most Samsung gas stoves. For other Samsung gas range models, the holes may be larger than the stove cover. You can customize for the unique size of your stove and counter. They are easily trimmed with household scissors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U-Muxg1QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TourKing","source_asin":"B09V72YHZ2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-86733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V72YHZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V72YHZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
