window.products.push({"id":86837,"name":"Euhomy Compact Laundry Dryer, 2.65 cu ft Front Load Stainless Steel Clothes Dryers With Exhaust Pipe, 1400W, LCD Control Panel Four-Function Portable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710j9mAbQiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High performance】This is powerful yet compact clothes dryer machine, euhomy portable dryer has a large capacity of 14.5 pounds(wet clothes). This dryer with 1400W power, It can reach a maximum temperature of 140°F, To ensure that your clothes dry quickly. Note: Use after spin-drying, the drying effect is better. 【Front and back flip function】 This portable clothes dryer has a large-diameter, stainless steel flip function and a special, internal physical structure to deliver the best possible drying experience. These features ensure sufficient clothes rotation, prevent tangles, remove wrinkles, and leaves your clothes fluffy and comfortable. The high efficiency, two-way flip function also helps save energy and reduces drying time. 【Multi-function】 Our electric clothes dryer machine features a liquid crystal display (LCD) and has four drying modes: 1.Strong: drying even larger items quickly. 2.Intelligent: This smarts mode automatically adjusts drying time based on humidity. Great for all items, even larger ones. 3.ECO: Deodorize any clothes ,dry small pieces of clothing 4.normal: More suitable for clothes that need ironing or drying small pieces of clothing. 【Intimate design】110 volt dryer: The wide-angle,105° door opening makes it easy to put in and take out your clothing. The transparent window allows you to observe the status of your load at any time, and if you do open the door while the machine is running, it will automatically stop running to ensure your safety. The cotton filters effectively filters out cotton wool to prevent it from flying out. The handle allows you to easily move the unit to wherever you’d like it. 【Portable and safe】 With its compact size and handle, this portable dryer is ideal for small spaces such as apartments, dormitories, etc. It can be installed on a countertop, on a firm, level ground or mounted with a bracket (bracket not included). ETL and DOE certifications guarantee the safety and quality of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710j9mAbQiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0C5DBKGTB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-86837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5DBKGTB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5DBKGTB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
